# Keep shell and build files LF in every checkout. A CRLF shebang or make
# recipe fails on Linux (`./configure: bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M`,
# `$'\r': command not found`) when a Windows checkout is built in WSL or a
# container. Sources keep the platform default.
.gitattributes text eol=lf
configure  text eol=lf
Makefile   text eol=lf
*.in       text eol=lf
*.mk       text eol=lf
*.sh       text eol=lf
*.py       text eol=lf
